                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fc4ec4be-c740-3298-b311-05efb0b92511",
                        "entry_id": "05403831-69c5-39c0-94c8-ec8b086e90d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tending to charm and flatter; smooth and flattering, especially when disingenuous."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30c99f73-b2f7-4d3b-beb7-36b063c08344",
                                "sense_id": "fc4ec4be-c740-3298-b311-05efb0b92511",
                                "text": "There was one Rumsey, a creature of Shaftesbury's, a man of very blandishing manners, with a sly, foxy expression of countenance, likely to put a physiognomist on his guard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc10445d-d270-4e34-894a-f2543f431a68",
                                "sense_id": "fc4ec4be-c740-3298-b311-05efb0b92511",
                                "text": "Mrs. Spivens could be very blandishing and fascinating when people had money to spend; but a poor girl wanting father—there was something too prosaic in that common every-day occurrence to rouse even into momentary compassion the pinions of Mrs. Spiven's lofty soul."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10386fdc-da7e-44d7-9f51-faf44a9997d6",
                                "sense_id": "fc4ec4be-c740-3298-b311-05efb0b92511",
                                "text": "There unquestionably are times in the life of every one, when either through a dislike of contemplating gloomy realities, or from an unwillingness to rack the mind by the investigation of abstract truth, or mazy science, a disposition is felt for resigning one's self to the enjoyment of those more blandishing scenes which the rainbow pencil of fancy is ever ready to paint."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
